      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-14T02:43:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I feel I should know this one, but . . . A quick question on the timing of redirecting Investigate damage with Amulet of the Elder Gods in play. &nbsp;Namely, when does the 2 card cost for the Amulet have to be paid? &nbsp;Is it (Investigate) damage (Investigate) draw, (Amulet) discard, (Amulet) redirect? &nbsp;Or is it (Investigate) damage, (Amulet) discard, (Amulet) redirect, (Investigate) draw? &nbsp;I think it's the first since I think I recall that we are to finish one card before applying the next. &nbsp;Am I right?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:50.526Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
