      "created_at": "2013-12-14T14:44:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wouldn't worry about it too much - Nightmist has plenty of ways to get more cards so you're likely to find that you end up with a reasonably-sized hand anyway, with plenty of options. And if not, you can always just make sure you play Nightmist when the other players are using heroes who can let you draw/play more cards or use more powers ;).</p>",
